  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "node_prologue",
      "title": "序章·海边",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "position": {
        "x": 80,
        "y": 300
      },
      "characterId": "char_narrator",
      "speaker": {},
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "海雾漫过礁石，灯塔在远处一明一灭。你已经走了很久，鞋里全是沙。",
        "en": "Sea fog crawls over the rocks. Far away, the lighthouse blinks. You have walked a long way, sand in your shoes.",
        "ja": "海霧が岩場を這い、遠くで灯台がまたたく。長い道のりだった。靴の中は砂だらけだ。"
      },
      "staleLocales": [],
      "entry": false,
      "entryLabel": "",
      "onEnter": [],
      "next": "",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "choice_go_lighthouse",
          "text": {
            "zh-CN": "朝灯塔走去",
            "en": "Head for the lighthouse",
            "ja": "灯台へ向かう"
          },
          "staleLocales": [],
          "condition": "",
          "effects": [],
          "target": "node_door"
        },
        {
          "id": "choice_search_beach",
          "text": {
            "zh-CN": "先在沙滩上找找",
            "en": "Search the beach first",
            "ja": "まず浜辺を探す"
          },
          "staleLocales": [],
          "condition": "",
          "effects": [],
          "target": "node_beach"
        }
      ],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "node_beach",
      "title": "退潮的沙滩",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "position": {
        "x": 400,
        "y": 470
      },
      "characterId": "char_narrator",
      "speaker": {},
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "潮水退去，沙里露出一小截铜光。是一把锈迹斑斑的钥匙。",
        "en": "The tide has pulled back, and a glint of brass shows in the sand. A rusted key.",
        "ja": "潮が引いた砂の中に、真鍮の光が覗いている。錆びた鍵だ。"
      },
      "staleLocales": [],
      "entry": false,
      "entryLabel": "",
      "onEnter": [],
      "next": "",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "choice_take_key",
          "text": {
            "zh-CN": "拾起铜钥匙",
            "en": "Pick up the brass key",
            "ja": "真鍮の鍵を拾う"
          },
          "staleLocales": [],
          "condition": "",
          "effects": [
            {
              "id": "fx_take_key",
              "variableId": "var_key",
              "op": "set",
              "value": true
            }
          ],
          "target": "node_door"
        },
        {
          "id": "choice_leave_key",
          "text": {
            "zh-CN": "空手离开",
            "en": "Leave it and go",
            "ja": "何も持たずに立ち去る"
          },
          "staleLocales": [],
          "condition": "",
          "effects": [],
          "target": "node_door"
        }
      ],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "node_door",
      "title": "灯塔门口（汇合点）",
      "type": "hub",
      "position": {
        "x": 720,
        "y": 300
      },
      "characterId": "char_narrator",
      "speaker": {},
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "铁门紧闭，门缝里透出一点暖光。风把门吹得哐当作响。",
        "en": "The iron door is shut tight, a sliver of warm light leaking through. The wind rattles it.",
        "ja": "鉄の扉は固く閉ざされ、隙間から暖かな光が漏れている。風が扉を揺らして鳴らす。"
      },
      "staleLocales": [],
      "entry": false,
      "entryLabel": "",
      "onEnter": [],
      "next": "",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "choice_use_key",
          "text": {
            "zh-CN": "用铜钥匙开门",
            "en": "Unlock the door with the key",
            "ja": "鍵で扉を開ける"
          },
          "staleLocales": [],
          "condition": "持有钥匙 == true",
          "effects": [],
          "target": "node_stairs"
        },
        {
          "id": "choice_knock",
          "text": {
            "zh-CN": "敲门",
            "en": "Knock",
            "ja": "扉を叩く"
          },
          "staleLocales": [],
          "condition": "",
          "effects": [],
          "target": "node_keeper_hub"
        }
      ],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "node_keeper_hub",
      "title": "守夜人（循环枢纽）",
      "type": "hub",
      "position": {
        "x": 1050,
        "y": 300
      },
      "characterId": "char_keeper",
      "speaker": {},
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "守夜人坐在炉火边，没有回头。“门没锁，是风在推。”",
        "en": "The keeper sits by the stove without turning. \"The door is not locked. That is the wind.\"",
        "ja": "灯守は炉のそばで振り向きもしない。「扉は開いている。風が押しているだけだ」"
      },
      "staleLocales": [],
      "entry": false,
      "entryLabel": "",
      "onEnter": [],
      "next": "",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "choice_ask_lighthouse",
          "text": {
            "zh-CN": "打听灯塔的事",
            "en": "Ask about the lighthouse",
            "ja": "灯台のことを尋ねる"
          },
          "staleLocales": [],
          "condition": "",
          "effects": [],
          "target": "node_keeper_talk"
        },
        {
          "id": "choice_rest",
          "text": {
            "zh-CN": "请求借宿一晚",
            "en": "Ask to stay the night",
            "ja": "一晩泊めてほしいと頼む"
          },
          "staleLocales": [],
          "condition": "信任 >= 2",
          "effects": [],
          "target": "node_end_rest"
        },
        {
          "id": "choice_leave_keeper",
          "text": {
            "zh-CN": "回到门口",
            "en": "Return to the door",
            "ja": "扉のところへ戻る"
          },
          "staleLocales": [],
          "condition": "",
          "effects": [],
          "target": "node_door"
        }
      ],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "node_keeper_talk",
      "title": "守夜人的回忆",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "position": {
        "x": 1050,
        "y": 620
      },
      "characterId": "char_keeper",
      "speaker": {},
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "“三十年前，我父亲也在这盏灯下等过一个人。后来灯灭了，人也没来。”",
        "en": "\"Thirty years ago my father waited beneath this lamp for someone too. Then the lamp went out, and no one came.\"",
        "ja": "「三十年前、父もこの灯の下で誰かを待っていた。やがて灯は消え、その人は来なかった」"
      },
      "staleLocales": [],
      "entry": false,
      "entryLabel": "",
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "id": "fx_trust_talk",
          "variableId": "var_trust",
          "op": "add",
          "value": 1
        }
      ],
      "next": "node_keeper_hub",
      "choices": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "node_stairs",
      "title": "旋梯",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "position": {
        "x": 1050,
        "y": 60
      },
      "characterId": "char_narrator",
      "speaker": {},
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "石阶又窄又陡，海风从窗口灌进来，一级一级往上，灯光越来越近。",
        "en": "The stone steps are narrow and steep. Sea wind pours through the window. With every step the light grows closer.",
        "ja": "石段は狭く険しい。窓から海風が吹き込む。一段上がるたび、灯が近づいてくる。"
      },
      "staleLocales": [],
      "entry": false,
      "entryLabel": "",
      "onEnter": [],
      "next": "node_lamp_room",
      "choices": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "node_lamp_room",
      "title": "灯室",
      "type": "hub",
      "position": {
        "x": 1380,
        "y": 60
      },
      "characterId": "char_narrator",
      "speaker": {},
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "巨大的透镜静静立在房间中央，灯芯只剩一点暗红。",
        "en": "The great lens stands still in the middle of the room. The wick is only a dull red ember.",
        "ja": "巨大なレンズが部屋の中央に静かに立っている。芯には暗い赤だけが残っていた。"
      },
      "staleLocales": [],
      "entry": false,
      "entryLabel": "",
      "onEnter": [],
      "next": "",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "choice_light",
          "text": {
            "zh-CN": "点亮灯塔",
            "en": "Light the lighthouse",
            "ja": "灯台に火をともす"
          },
          "staleLocales": [],
          "condition": "信任 >= 2",
          "effects": [
            {
              "id": "fx_light",
              "variableId": "var_lit",
              "op": "set",
              "value": true
            }
          ],
          "target": "node_end_dawn"
        },
        {
          "id": "choice_turn_back",
          "text": {
            "zh-CN": "转身下楼",
            "en": "Turn back down the stairs",
            "ja": "階段を下りる"
          },
          "staleLocales": [],
          "condition": "",
          "effects": [],
          "target": "node_end_return"
        }
      ],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "node_ch2_entry",
      "title": "第二章·灯室",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "position": {
        "x": 1380,
        "y": 380
      },
      "characterId": "char_narrator",
      "speaker": {},
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "（第二章起点）你在天亮前爬到了灯室，手里还攥着那枚冰凉的钥匙。",
        "en": "(Chapter Two entry) You climbed to the lamp room before dawn, the cold key still in your hand.",
        "ja": "（第二章開始）夜明け前に灯室へたどり着いた。冷たい鍵をまだ握りしめている。"
      },
      "staleLocales": [],
      "entry": true,
      "entryLabel": "第二章：灯室",
      "onEnter": [],
      "next": "node_lamp_room",
      "choices": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "node_end_dawn",
      "title": "结局·黎明",
      "type": "end",
      "position": {
        "x": 1740,
        "y": 60
      },
      "characterId": "char_narrator",
      "speaker": {},
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "灯亮起来的那一刻，雾向海面退去。远处的船鸣了一声笛。",
        "en": "The moment the lamp catches, the fog retreats toward the sea. A ship sounds its horn in the distance.",
        "ja": "灯がともった瞬間、霧は海へと退いていった。遠くで船が汽笛を鳴らす。"
      },
      "staleLocales": [],
      "entry": false,
      "entryLabel": "",
      "onEnter": [],
      "next": "",
      "choices": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "node_end_return",
      "title": "结局·归途",
      "type": "end",
      "position": {
        "x": 1740,
        "y": 380
      },
      "characterId": "char_narrator",
      "speaker": {},
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你回到雾里。身后的灯依旧一明一灭，像一声没有说完的话。",
        "en": "You walk back into the fog. Behind you the lamp still blinks, like a sentence left unfinished.",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "staleLocales": [],
      "entry": false,
      "entryLabel": "",
      "onEnter": [],
