        "y": 700
      },
      "characterId": "char_keeper",
      "speaker": {},
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "守夜人往炉子里添了一块柴。“睡吧。天亮之前，雾不会散。”",
        "en": "The keeper adds a log to the stove. \"Sleep. The fog will not lift before dawn.\"",
        "ja": ""
      },
